Additional notice (non-binding, but please read before forking):

This project's core value is its *governance behaviour* — the consent ordering
in `src/services/consent.mjs`, the fail-closed defaults, and the audit
invariants asserted in `test/`. If you fork it, keeping those tests green is
the difference between "a personal agent" and "a thing that asks for
permission once and then does whatever it wants".
